---
/**
 * @category Feature
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Feature2
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='flex flex-col gap-16 md:gap-20 xl:gap-24'>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-8'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:col-span-7 md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Edit on the canvas, publish anywhere</h2>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:col-span-5 dark:text-stone-400'>Starquix is a visual editor on your Mac. Everything it saves is an ordinary Astro project you can open, build and version like any other.</p>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-8'>
      <img class='block aspect-[5/4] h-auto w-full rounded-[1.25rem] object-cover md:col-span-7 md:rounded-[2rem]' src='/assets/images/content/snippet.webp' alt='A retro computer screen set in a red control panel, showing Astro markup with Tailwind classes' width='1024' height='1024' />
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 md:col-span-5 xl:col-span-4 xl:col-start-9'>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Edit text in place</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Click a heading on the canvas and type. Starquix writes the change into the .astro file it came from, so your repository always matches the page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-8'>
      <img class='block aspect-[5/4] h-auto w-full rounded-[1.25rem] object-cover md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6 md:row-start-1 md:rounded-[2rem]' src='/assets/images/content/spaceship1.webp' alt='A white spaceship resting in a field of red flowers under a yellow sky' width='2400' height='1920' />
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1 xl:col-span-4'>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Publish to your own host</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Publish to Vercel or GitHub Pages from the editor, or export the project as a zip and upload it yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
